      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Luo tribe’s army keeps losing until Luo Bo Jun loses the will to keep fighting and orders surrender himself, since a poison vow stops his subordinates from raising the idea first. The surrender gives Liu tribe alliance its first win of that stretch of the Imperial Court contest.",
